---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const props = {
  "page": "testimonials",
  "title": "Stories — Emerging Clarity",
  "description": "In their own words — reflections from people who have worked with Roberto Chavarria on their journey of clarity, depth, and emergence.",
  "canonical": "https://emergingclarity.com/testimonials/",
  "ogType": "website",
  "ogTitle": "Stories — Emerging Clarity",
  "ogDescription": "In their own words — reflections from people who have worked with Roberto Chavarria.",
  "ogImage": "https://emergingclarity.com/assets/og-image.jpg",
  "twitterTitle": "Stories — Emerging Clarity",
  "twitterDescription": "In their own words — reflections from people who have worked with Roberto Chavarria.",
  "twitterImage": "https://emergingclarity.com/assets/og-image.jpg",
  "noscriptCss": ".reveal{opacity:1 !important;transform:none !important}"
};
---
<BaseLayout {...props}>
<main id="main">
  <section class="pagehero" data-screen-label="Testimonials hero">
    <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap" style="position:relative">
      <div class="eyebrow reveal in">In their words</div>
      <h1 class="reveal in" data-d="1">What it&rsquo;s like to be <span class="aqua">met</span>.</h1>
      <p class="lede reveal in" data-d="2">I&rsquo;ve been lucky to walk alongside some remarkable people. Here is what a few of them have shared about the journey.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 30px" data-screen-label="Testimonials list">
    <div class="wrap wrap-wide">
      <div class="tlist">

        <article class="tcard reveal" id="t-andre">
          <div class="tcard__pull"><p>The quality of his questions allowed us to dive deep into the issues I was facing&mdash;much deeper than I had ever gone in almost a year of therapy.</p></div>
          <div class="tcard__body">
            <p>&ldquo;I recently had the pleasure of working with Roberto for eight weeks, and I can confidently say it was one of the most valuable experiences I&rsquo;ve ever had. In the past, I often felt that services like this didn&rsquo;t quite justify the investment. However, Roberto completely changed my perspective.</p>
            <p>From our very first session, it was clear that Roberto has a unique talent. He has an incredible ability to read body language, which made me feel understood in a way I hadn&rsquo;t experienced before. He&rsquo;s also an exceptional listener, and the quality of his questions truly set him apart. They were so insightful that they allowed us to dive deep into the issues I was facing&mdash;much deeper than I had ever gone in almost a year of therapy.</p>
            <p>If you&rsquo;re looking to make meaningful changes in your life, I wholeheartedly recommend Roberto. The progress we made in just eight weeks was astounding, and I came away from each session feeling like I had truly taken a step forward. This experience was worth every penny.&rdquo;</p>
            <div class="tcard__who"><span class="tcard__av">A</span><span><span class="tcard__nm">André A.</span><br /><span class="tcard__lc">Portugal</span></span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="tcard tcard--flip reveal" id="t-aydin">
          <div class="tcard__body">
            <p>&ldquo;Roberto transcends the role of a mentor; he has been a transformative force and a profound catalyst in my journey of personal growth and self-discovery. His empathy and wisdom have been instrumental in unveiling my inner gifts and purpose, fostering significant growth and self-awareness. Roberto listens with intent and guides with a gentle precision that empowers me to discover the answers within myself.</p>
            <p>He consistently embodies the principles he teaches, blending intelligence and compassion with ease, and breaking down complex ideas into actionable insights. His approach is open-hearted and free from judgment, encouraging a journey of self-discovery and fostering a deeper connection with my highest self.</p>
            <p>Each session with Roberto feels like a substantial step forward. He utilizes a variety of approaches, tools, and practices, to ensure our time together is always mindful, intentional and focused on what is resonating most. He also offers me tools and strategies to hold me accountable and support my progress when we are not in session.</p>
            <p>In Roberto, I&rsquo;ve found not merely a guide but an inspirational force guiding me towards my true potential. His impact is a priceless gift that continues to influence my path, and for his unwavering support and wisdom, I am deeply grateful.&rdquo;</p>
            <div class="tcard__who"><span class="tcard__av">A</span><span><span class="tcard__nm">Aydin S.</span><br /><span class="tcard__lc">Colorado, US</span></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tcard__pull"><p>In Roberto, I&rsquo;ve found not merely a guide but an inspirational force guiding me towards my true potential.</p></div>
        </article>

        <article class="tcard reveal" id="t-benian">
          <div class="tcard__pull"><p>It&rsquo;s about allowing things to naturally emerge in the moment&mdash;then dissecting them together, uncovering their roots and finding resolution.</p></div>
          <div class="tcard__body">
            <p>&ldquo;Without any agenda or &lsquo;teaching&rsquo;, Roberto creates a space for you to become present, to trust and to feel peace, because he truly embodies these things himself. I really felt seen throughout the process, because he showed so much genuine curiosity.</p>
            <p>I admire how he understood and reflected back with precision my subconscious beliefs, through which he made me aware of my mind&rsquo;s stories and helped me to create a distance between me and them, which resulted in a great sense of inner peace.</p>
            <p>Working with Roberto isn&rsquo;t about tackling preconceived issues, it&rsquo;s about allowing things to naturally emerge in the moment and then dissecting them together, uncovering their roots and finding resolution. He really goes below the surface layer of problems and stories, and I&rsquo;m deeply grateful for the journey with him.&rdquo;</p>
            <div class="tcard__who"><span class="tcard__av">B</span><span><span class="tcard__nm">Benian T.</span><br /><span class="tcard__lc">Portugal</span></span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="tcard tcard--flip reveal" id="t-james">
          <div class="tcard__body">
            <p>&ldquo;As a professional life coach and mentor with a decade of experience, I can say from firsthand experience that Roberto is the real deal! He not only possesses the skills needed to support others but also embodies the authenticity of someone who sincerely strives to live by the truths he shares.</p>
            <p>When I am the recipient of Roberto&rsquo;s spacious listening, poignant questioning, and remarkable sense-making capabilities, I always leave the conversation feeling more clear and inspired in areas where I was previously feeling confused and discouraged. Roberto has a gift of truly seeing people and calling forth from them that which is most authentic and true.&rdquo;</p>
            <div class="tcard__who"><span class="tcard__av">J</span><span><span class="tcard__nm">James F.</span><br /><span class="tcard__lc">Colorado, US</span></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tcard__pull"><p>Roberto has a gift of truly seeing people and calling forth from them that which is most authentic and true.</p></div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--panel ctaband" data-screen-label="Testimonials CTA">
    <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap" style="position:relative">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow center">Free first session</div>
        <h2 style="margin-top:22px">See what becomes possible in a real conversation.</h2>
        <p class="lede">The first session is free. We&rsquo;ll spend time with whatever has brought you here and see where the conversation leads.</p>
        <div style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center">
          <a class="btn btn--aqua" href="/connect/">Book a free first session
            <svg width="17" height="12" viewBox="0 0 18 12" fill="none"><path d="M1 6h15M11 1l5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="tlink" href="/work/">See how the work unfolds
            <svg width="17" height="12" viewBox="0 0 18 12" fill="none"><path d="M1 6h15M11 1l5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

</BaseLayout>
<style is:global>
.pagehero { padding: 168px 0 56px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .pagehero .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .pagehero h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 64px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; max-width: 15ch; }
  .pagehero h1 .aqua { color: var(--aqua); }
  .pagehero .lede { margin-top: 28px; max-width: 52ch; }

  .tlist { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap: 22px; }
  .tcard {
    display:grid; grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr; gap: 44px; align-items:center;
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 48px;
    transition: border-color .4s var(--ease), background .4s var(--ease);
    scroll-margin-top: 110px;
  }
  .tcard:hover { border-color: rgba(132,194,198,.32); background: var(--card-2); }
  .tcard--flip { grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px; }
  .tcard--flip .tcard__pull { order: 2; }

  .tcard__pull { position: relative; border: 1.5px solid var(--aqua); background: rgba(132,194,198,.06); border-radius: 16px; padding: 40px 32px; }
  .tcard__pull::before { content:"\201C"; position:absolute; top: 48px; left: 22px; font-size: 64px; line-height: 0; color: var(--aqua); }
  .tcard__pull p { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing:-0.01em; color: var(--quote-text); text-align:center; margin: 18px 0 0; }

  .tcard__body p { color: var(--dim); font-size: 16.5px; margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.62; }
  .tcard__body p:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .tcard__who { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; margin-top: 26px; padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .tcard__av { width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--aqua-deep), var(--aqua)); color:var(--on-aqua); display:grid; place-items:center; font-weight:800; font-size:19px; flex:none; }
  .tcard__nm { font-weight:700; font-size:17px; }
  .tcard__lc { font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--faint); }

  .ctaband { text-align:center; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .ctaband h2 { font-size: clamp(36px,5vw,68px); letter-spacing:-0.04em; }
  .ctaband .lede { margin: 20px auto 38px; max-width: 48ch; }

  @media (max-width: 860px){
    .tcard, .tcard--flip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; padding: 32px 26px; }
    .tcard--flip .tcard__pull { order: 0; }
  }
</style>
